{{/* Renders "true" when this chezmoi apply renders config for a Claude Code that runs inside a
container, "" otherwise -- callers write {{ if includeTemplate "is-container" . }}. Two ways in:
the apply itself runs in a container (docker writes /.dockerenv, podman /run/.containerenv), or
the host sets `claude_in_container = true` under [data] in its chezmoi config, for a container
that bind-mounts a ~/.claude rendered outside it. No host in this repo's fleet sets the key.
A distrobox or toolbox container (both write /run/.toolboxenv) does not count. It shares $HOME,
and so ~/.claude, with the host, and it uses the host's network, so the docker join below has
nothing to join. Counting it made host and container render two different settings.json.
Gates the SessionStart `docker network connect workspace_default` hook (#621). */ -}}
{{- if or (and (hasKey . "claude_in_container") .claude_in_container) (and (or (stat "/.dockerenv") (stat "/run/.containerenv")) (not (includeTemplate "is-toolbox" .))) -}}
true
{{- end -}}
